    "headline": "Quanta (NYSE:PWR) Reports Upbeat Q2 CY2026, Stock Jumps 13.5%",
    "summary": "Infrastructure solutions provider Quanta (NYSE:PWR) reported Q2 CY2026 results topping the market’s revenue expectations, with sales up 41.1% year on year to $9.56 billion. The company’s full-year revenue guidance of $39.5 billion at the midpoint came in 12.8% above analysts’ estimates. Its non-GAAP profit of $4.24 per share was 28.1% above analysts’ consensus estimates.",
